dsh-web-fetch-enhanced

This project uses @deepseek-ai/dsh-web-fetch-http from DeepSeek Harness at
runtime: its HttpFetchProvider (URL policy, redirect handling, proxy routing,
address-pinned transport, timeouts, size limits, and content decoding) is
imported as a dependency, not copied. The DNS answer-set validation and the
RFC 6052 / RFC 7050 NAT64 handling in src/providers/local/resolver.ts are
adapted from that package's network module.

